This crate (shpx-driver-spatialite) bundles libspatialite under the
`bundled-spatialite` Cargo feature. The bundled C source is included
in-tree under `vendor/libspatialite-5.1.0/` and is statically linked
into the resulting binary by `build.rs` via the `cc` crate.

